Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

User requested only Facebook + Instagram logos across the site.

- src/components/site/footer.tsx: socials array now only contains
  Facebook + Instagram (was Twitter, Instagram, Globe, Github).
- src/components/site/hero.tsx: hero bottom-left social strip now
  only shows Facebook + Instagram (was Twitter, Instagram, Globe).
- src/lib/data.ts: added social.facebook to FALLBACK_SETTINGS
  (https://facebook.com/n2klabs). Legacy twitter/website/github keys
  kept for backward compat but no longer rendered.
- prisma/seed.ts: upserts social.facebook on every deploy (idempotent).
- src/components/site/admin-shared.tsx: Settings → Social Links group
  now only has Facebook URL + Instagram URL fields (with a description
  noting only those two are shown on the site).

Verified locally: footer social labels = [Facebook, Instagram];
hero social labels = [Facebook, Instagram]; admin Social Links group
shows only Facebook URL + Instagram URL labels (Twitter/Website/GitHub
labels all absent).
